'''Jack Reacher''' is the protagonist of a [[Jack Reacher (novel series)|series of crime thriller]] novels by British author [[Lee Child]],<ref name="CurtisMarch2013">{{cite web|last=Curtis|first=Bryan|title=The Curious Case of Lee Child: Before Tom Cruise could become Jack Reacher, Jim Grant had to become Lee Child|url=http://www.grantland.com/story/_/id/8766396/lee-child-jim-grant-jack-reacher|magazine=[[Grantland]]|access-date=5 September 2015|date=20 December 2012|archive-date=29 October 2013|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20131029202159/http://www.grantland.com/story/_/id/8766396/lee-child-jim-grant-jack-reacher|url-status=live}}</ref> a [[Jack Reacher (film)|2012 film adaptation]], its [[Jack Reacher: Never Go Back|2016 sequel]], and [[Reacher (TV series)|a television series]] on [[Amazon Prime Video]]. A former [[Major (rank)|major]] in the U.S. Army's [[Military Police Corps (United States)|military police]], Reacher is a [[Hobo|drifter]] roaming the United States, investigating suspicious and dangerous situations.

{{as of|2025|12|31}}, there are 30 novels and short stories in the ''Reacher'' series. Six of the novels were adapted for cinema and television. Two of the adaptations are films starring [[Tom Cruise]] as Reacher: ''[[Jack Reacher (film)|Jack Reacher]]'' (2012) from the ninth novel, ''[[One Shot (novel)|One Shot]];'' and ''[[Jack Reacher: Never Go Back]]'' (2016) from the eighteenth novel, ''[[Never Go Back (novel)|Never Go Back]]''.

The third adaptation, ''[[Reacher (TV series)|Reacher]]'', is a television series on [[Amazon Prime Video]], starring [[Alan Ritchson]]. The first season, adapted from the first novel, ''[[Killing Floor (novel)|Killing Floor]]'', premiered on 4 February 2022. The second season, from ''[[Bad Luck and Trouble]],'' premiered 14 December 2023. The third season, based on the seventh book ''[[Persuader (novel)|Persuader]]'', premiered on 20 February 2025. The fourth season, based on the novel ''[[Gone Tomorrow (novel)|Gone Tomorrow]]'', premiered on 12 August 2026.
